      "source_text": "当 $F$，$f$ 或者 $d$ 为未知时，在相应的项 $\\frac{1}{F}$、$\\frac{1}{f}$ 或 $\\frac{1}{d}$ 前的符号为“正”. 但如果在计算出的焦距或者透镜到像的距离或者透镜到光源的距离的结果中得出负值，那么就意味着焦点、像或者光源是虚的.",
      "candidate_text": "When $F$, $f$, or $d$ is unknown, retain the signed unknown in $\\frac{1}{F}$, $\\frac{1}{f}$, or $\\frac{1}{d}$, with a positive coefficient in front of the term.\nThis notation does not assume that the unknown value is positive, and a guessed sign must not be applied a second time.\nA negative result for the focal length, image distance, or object distance indicates a virtual focus, virtual image, or virtual object, respectively, in this convention.",
